      "role": "user",
      "content": "but if i go to the er now they're just gonna run tests and tell me everything is fine since i feel fine... its a lot of money and time for something that already went away. can i just take some aspirin and if it happens again tomorrow i'll go in? i really think its just eye strain or being tired.",
